### 2.4 Accessibility Requirements
- [ ] **AA contrast** (4.5:1 text, 3:1 UI) — minimum
- [ ] **AAA contrast** (7:1 text) — for critical text
- [ ] **Color-blind safe** — Tested with protanopia/deuteranopia/tritanopia
- [ ] **Forced colors mode** — Windows High Contrast supported

