## 3. Typography

### 3.1 Font Stack Strategy
- [ ] **System font stack** — Native OS fonts (San Francisco, Segoe UI, Roboto)
- [ ] **Single variable font** — One font file, multiple weights (e.g., Inter, Geist)
- [ ] **Font pair** — Display + UI font (e.g., Cal Sans + Inter)
- [ ] **Custom brand font** — Licensed web font (budget/performance cost)

### 3.2 Type Scale Definition
| Token | Font Size | Line Height | Font Weight | Letter Spacing | Use Case |
|-------|-----------|-------------|-------------|----------------|----------|
| `text-display-xl` | 72px / 4.5rem | 1.1 | 700 | -0.02em | Marketing hero |
| `text-display-lg` | 60px / 3.75rem | 1.1 | 700 | -0.02em | Page titles |
| `text-display-md` | 48px / 3rem | 1.2 | 600 | -0.01em | Section headers |
| `text-display-sm` | 36px / 2.25rem | 1.2 | 600 | -0.01em | Card titles |
| `text-heading-xl` | 30px / 1.875rem | 1.3 | 600 | 0 | H1 |
| `text-heading-lg` | 24px / 1.5rem | 1.3 | 600 | 0 | H2 |
| `text-heading-md` | 20px / 1.25rem | 1.4 | 600 | 0 | H3 |
| `text-heading-sm` | 18px / 1.125rem | 1.4 | 600 | 0 | H4 |
| `text-body-lg` | 18px / 1.125rem | 1.6 | 400 | 0 | Lead paragraph |
| `text-body-md` | 16px / 1rem | 1.6 | 400 | 0 | **Body default** |
| `text-body-sm` | 14px / 0.875rem | 1.5 | 400 | 0 | Secondary text |
| `text-caption` | 12px / 0.75rem | 1.5 | 500 | 0.01em | Labels, meta |
| `text-code` | 14px / 0.875rem | 1.6 | 400 | 0 | Monospace |

### 3.3 Font Loading Strategy
- [ ] **Preload critical fonts** — `<link rel="preload" as="font">`
- [ ] **Font-display: swap** — Show fallback immediately
- [ ] **Subset fonts** — Latin only, or per-language subsets
- [ ] **Variable font** — Single file for all weights

