## 5. Border Radius & Elevation

### 5.1 Border Radius Scale
| Token | Value | Use Case |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `radius-none` | 0 | Sharp corners (tables, code) |
| `radius-sm` | 4px | Badges, tags, small inputs |
| `radius-md` | 8px | **Default** — buttons, cards, inputs |
| `radius-lg` | 12px | Modals, dropdowns, panels |
| `radius-xl` | 16px | Large cards, feature blocks |
| `radius-2xl` | 24px | Hero elements |
| `radius-full` | 9999px | Pills, avatars, progress |

### 5.2 Elevation / Shadow Scale
| Token | Value | Use Case |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `shadow-none` | none | Flat |
| `shadow-sm` | `0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05)` | Cards, inputs (hover) |
| `shadow-md` | `0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)` | Dropdowns, tooltips |
| `shadow-lg` | `0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)` | Modals, drawers |
| `shadow-xl` | `0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)` | Overlays, popovers |
| `shadow-inner` | `inset 0 2px 4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05)` | Inputs (focus) |

> **Dark mode**: Shadows use `rgb(0 0 0 / opacity)` — works on both backgrounds.

