## 6. Component Library Strategy

### 6.1 Build vs. Buy vs. Adopt
| Component Category | Decision | Library/Notes |
|--------------------|----------|---------------|
| **Primitives** (Button, Input, Checkbox) | [Build / Adopt] | [shadcn/ui, Radix, Headless UI, custom] |
| **Composites** (Select, DatePicker, Table) | [Build / Adopt] | [Same or different] |
| **Layout** (Grid, Stack, Container) | [Build / Adopt] | [Custom tokens + CSS Grid] |
| **Feedback** (Toast, Modal, Tooltip) | [Build / Adopt] | [Sonner, Radix, custom] |
| **Navigation** (Tabs, Breadcrumb, Pagination) | [Build / Adopt] | [Custom] |
| **Data Display** (Table, List, Card, Badge) | [Build / Adopt] | [TanStack Table + custom] |
| **Forms** (Form, FieldArray, Validation) | [Build / Adopt] | [React Hook Form + Zod + custom] |

### 6.2 Component API Conventions
- [ ] **Compound components** — `<Select><Select.Trigger /><Select.Content /></Select>`
- [ ] **Render props** — `<Select render={({ open }) => ...} />`
- [ ] **Props-only** — `<Select options={[]} onChange={...} />`
- [ ] **ClassName-based** — `className="select-trigger"` (Tailwind)

### 6.3 Variant System
| Approach | Example |
|----------|---------|
| **CVA (Class Variance Authority)** | `button({ variant: 'primary', size: 'lg' })` |
| **Tailwind `variants` plugin** | `@variants primary { ... }` |
| **Manual className merging** | `cn(base, variants[variant], variants[size])` |
| **Styled-system / Theme UI** | `<Button variant="primary" size="lg" />` |

> **Recommendation**: CVA + Tailwind for type-safe variants with zero runtime.

