## 7. Motion & Animation

### 7.1 Motion Philosophy
- [ ] **Functional only** — Feedback, state transitions, spatial relationships
- [ ] **Expressive** — Brand moments, onboarding, empty states
- [ ] **Reduced motion first** — All animations respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

### 7.2 Animation Tokens
| Token | Duration | Easing | Use Case |
|-------|----------|--------|----------|
| `motion-instant` | 0ms | linear | Immediate feedback |
| `motion-fast` | 100ms | `ease-out` | Hover, focus, tap |
| `motion-normal` | 200ms | `ease-in-out` | **Default** — transitions |
| `motion-slow` | 300ms | `ease-out` | Modals, drawers, toasts |
| `motion-slower` | 500ms | `ease-in-out` | Page transitions |

### 7.3 Standard Transitions
```css
/* Define once, use everywhere */
.transition-fast { transition: all 100ms ease-out; }
.transition-normal { transition: all 200ms ease-in-out; }
.transition-slow { transition: all 300ms ease-out; }

/* Property-specific */
.transition-colors { transition: color, background-color, border-color 200ms ease-in-out; }
.transform-transition { transition: transform 200ms ease-out; }
.opacity-transition { transition: opacity 200ms ease-in-out; }
```

