## 9. Dark Mode Strategy

### 9.1 Implementation Approach
- [ ] **CSS custom properties** — `:root` + `[data-theme="dark"]` (recommended)
- [ ] **Tailwind `dark:` variant** — Class-based (`dark:` prefix)
- [ ] **Media query only** — `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)`
- [ ] **Manual toggle + persistence** — User preference stored in localStorage/cookie

### 9.2 Color Inversion Rules
| Light | Dark | Rule |
|-------|------|------|
| `neutral-50` → `neutral-950` | Backgrounds invert |
| `neutral-900` → `neutral-50` | Text inverts |
| `brand-600` → `brand-400` | Primary shifts lighter |
| `shadow-*` | Same values | Shadows work on dark (black with opacity) |
| Images | Optional `filter: brightness(0.9)` | Reduce glare |

