## 11. Accessibility Checklist (Per Component)

### 11.1 Required for Every Interactive Component
- [ ] **Keyboard accessible** — Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys
- [ ] **Focus visible** — `:focus-visible` ring (never `outline: none` without replacement)
- [ ] **ARIA labels** — `aria-label`, `aria-labelledby`, or visible label
- [ ] **Role** — Implicit (native HTML) or explicit (`role="button"`)
- [ ] **State** — `aria-expanded`, `aria-selected`, `aria-disabled`, `aria-pressed`
- [ ] **Live regions** — `aria-live` for dynamic updates (toasts, errors)

### 11.2 Testing Requirements
- [ ] **axe-core** — Automated in CI
- [ ] **Screen reader** — NVDA (Windows), VoiceOver (Mac), TalkBack (Android)
- [ ] **Keyboard-only** — Full flow without mouse
- [ ] **Zoom** — 200% browser zoom, 400% text-only zoom
- [ ] **Reduced motion** — `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`

