## 12. Design Tokens Implementation

### 12.1 Token Format
- [ ] **Style Dictionary** — JSON/YAML source → multi-platform output (CSS, JS, iOS, Android)
- [ ] **CSS Custom Properties only** — Native, no build step
- [ ] **Figma Tokens plugin** — Design → code sync
- [ ] **Custom JSON + build script** — Tailwind config generation

### 12.2 Token Structure (Style Dictionary Example)
```json
{
  "color": {
    "brand": {
      "500": { "value": "#3b82f6", "type": "color" }
    },
    "semantic": {
      "primary": { "value": "{color.brand.500}", "type": "color" }
    }
  },
  "spacing": {
    "4": { "value": "16px", "type": "dimension" }
  }
}
```

### 12.3 Theming Pipeline
```
Figma Tokens → style-dictionary.json → build →
  ├── tailwind.config.ts (CSS vars + Tailwind theme)
  ├── tokens.css (raw CSS custom properties)
  ├── tokens.ts (TypeScript constants)
  └── tokens.swift / tokens.kt (mobile)
```

